@startuml F7.2-D02-criar-perfil
title F7.2-D02 — Criar perfil customizado
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "IAMController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateRoleUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Salvar perfil
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /admin/perfis
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: INSERT role\n+ perfil_authority\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Admin: badge Customizado

@enduml
